--Test script (modded exes: an example of a DXML on_xml_read callback)
-- RayLink: its one job, adding the exe name to the main menu's version line (ui_st_game_version of
-- text\<lang>\_game_version.xml), is the engine's now: string_table.cpp appends "RayLink Engine b28" once every text
-- file is loaded, so the line names the engine also when a later file defines the string (G.A.M.M.A.'s text overhaul
-- does). The file stays, empty, so that it covers the modded exes' copy of the same name in the game folder.

function on_xml_read()
end
